{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110801001:0":{"text":"자, 이제부터 바빠지겠네.","source_cn":"好了，我们该忙起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55FAA77C4FD36EDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110801002:0":{"text":"오랫동안 자리를 비웠으니, 부족에 처리해야 할 일이 많을 거야!","source_cn":"离开了这么久，族里一定有很多事需要我们处理！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC848342BE73E506E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110801003:0":{"text":"아르사 언니! 왜 이제 온 거야!","source_cn":"阿尔萨姐姐！你们终于回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D11394701D222B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110801004:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">세르바</style>랑... 사람들이... 흑흑...","source_cn":"<style=highlight>瑟巴</style>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4D0D114DF78BF89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110801005:0":{"text":"어라, 우리 귀여운 하피가 왜 울까? 울지 마. 세르바가 또 괴롭혔어?","source_cn":"哈，我们可爱的哈佩怎么了？别哭别哭，让我猜猜，是小瑟巴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39BF9FEDD0BB294","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110801006:0":{"text":"아니... 그게 아니라... 다들 <style=\"highlight\">보물찾기</style>를 하러 갔는데, 지금까지 아무런 연락이 없어... 하피 너무 무서워...","source_cn":"不……没……大家吵着要去<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568DA3553BD250C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1110801006":{"text":"아니... 그게 아니라... 다들 <style=\"highlight\">보물찾기</style>를 하러 갔는데, 지금까지 아무런 연락이 없어... 하피 너무 무서워...","source_cn":"不……没……大家吵着要去<style=highlight>寻宝</style>，但到现在一点消息都没有，哈佩很害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568DA3553BD250C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110801007:1":{"text":"아르사 언니랑 소렌 오빠가 군가 축제에 참가하러 떠나고 지나가던 장사꾼들이 근처에 잠시 머물렀어요. 그 사람들은 커다란 짐도 많고, 엄청나게 큰 말도 있었어요...","source_cn":"阿尔萨姐姐和索恩哥哥出发参加战歌节之后，有一群路过卖东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B349F7D74C6A6B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110801008:1":{"text":"그 사람들은 해가 떠오르는 방향 쪽 <style=\"highlight\">침식된 영토에 보물이 숨겨져 있다고</style> 했죠.","source_cn":"他们说，往太阳升起的方向，那边的<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04112BE8B5436381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110801009:1":{"text":"그래서 세르바랑 다른 언니 오빠들 모두 보물 얘기를 듣고 찾으러 가겠다고 했는데...!","source_cn":"听到宝藏的消息，瑟巴，还有其他一些哥哥姐姐，决定要跟那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10910E30ECF889AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110801010:1":{"text":"... 지금까지 돌아오지도 않고, 소식도 없다?","source_cn":"……但他们到现在也没传回消息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F52D49877A5F820","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110801011:0":{"text":"응... 여기서 다들 돌아올 때까지 계속 기다렸는데, 아무런 소식이 없어서 너무 걱정돼...","source_cn":"没有……我在族里等了很久很久，直到你们都回来了，他们还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D6CCBEADE701062","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110801012:0":{"text":"우리가 왔으니까, 걱정하지 마. 나랑 소렌이 꼭 데리고 올게.","source_cn":"别怕，有我们在。我和索恩一定会把他们带回来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BE3CDC1D4046A8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110801013:0":{"text":"아, 진짜 바보 같은 애들이라니까...","source_cn":"唉，真是一群傻孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x246392EB2CAECF4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1110801013":{"text":"아, 진짜 바보 같은 애들이라니까...","source_cn":"唉，真是一群傻孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x246392EB2CAECF4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110801014:1":{"text":"걔네들보단 나이가 많잖아! 내가 언니니까, 책임지고 동생들을 돌봐야 한다구!","source_cn":"我比他们大！作为大家的姐姐，当然应该承担起照顾他们的责任！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D93317E1E03B02A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110801015:1":{"text":"꾸물거릴 시간 없어. 소렌, 짐 챙겨. 당장 출발하자!","source_cn":"不能再耽误了。索恩，收拾一下，我们马上就出发！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8174B09045724E81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110801016:0":{"text":"우선 진정하고 생각을 좀 해보자.","source_cn":"冷静一下，好好想想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E278106FD64FEFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110801017:1":{"text":"우리가 자리를 너무 오래 비웠어. 우르 부족은 지금 통솔자가 필요하다고.","source_cn":"我们离开这么久，现在乌尔氏族需要有人统领。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FA009BCD5F1206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110801018:1":{"text":"넌 여기 남아. 내가 갈게.","source_cn":"你留下，我去找。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B1F561FC0B6B8FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","documen